<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-007" chapter-id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-wangshu-yun" source-id="s-jinshu-007-jin076-wangshu-yun">
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-wangshu-yun:shudeath" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">六月甲辰，撫軍將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-wangshu-yun:shudeath:m0009" ref="nbl_2bu_99w">王舒</persName>卒。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-wangshu-yun:yunappointed" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以江州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-wangshu-yun:yunappointed:m0005" ref="a04_d8f_416">王允之</persName>爲衛將軍。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-wangshu-yun:yundeath" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">冬十月甲午，衛將軍<persName id="c-jinshu-007-jin076-wangshu-yun:yundeath:m0009" ref="a04_d8f_416">王允之</persName>卒。</p>
</text>
